	(text "RN1..RN4: 16 RGB lines; RN5: PCLK/HSYNC/VSYNC/DE.\nPlace close to J1; leave the RGB corridor clear for later routing.\nUse isolated 0603 x4 (3216 package), not a common-pin array."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 187.96 0)
		(effects
